return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T17:59:41+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T17:59:41+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Akiba ya kurasa na akiba ya vipengee ya Redis kwa tovuti yoyote ya WordPress. Hutumia akiba ya seva ya LiteSpeed inapopatikana na akiba yake ya diski kwingineko kote, husafisha tu kile kinachoathiriwa na mabadiliko, na kuthibitisha kuwa muunganisho wake wa Redis unafanya kazi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kache','Page cache'=>'Akiba-muda ya ukurasa','Object cache'=>'Kache ya vipengee','Purging'=>'Inasafisha','Exclusions'=>'Vighairi','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'Safisha kila kitu sasa','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Kila ukurasa uliohifadhiwa kwenye kache hutupwa na utaundwa upya wageni wanapowasili. Ungependa kuendelea?','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ruhusu mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Imezimwa: zana zilizo hapa chini na njia zao za REST hazijasajiliwa kabisa.','Full-page cache'=>'Kache ya ukurasa kamili','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Kwenye seva ya LiteSpeed, kurasa hutolewa na seva ya wavuti kabla ya WordPress kuanza kufanya kazi. Kwenye seva nyingine yoyote, programu-jalizi hii huhifadhi kila ukurasa kama faili na kuutoa kabla ya WordPress kupakia. Hapa ndipo karibu kasi yote inatoka.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Hifadhi kurasa kwenye kache kwa wageni ambao hawajaingia','How long a page stays cached'=>'Muda ambao ukurasa unasalia kwenye kache','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Sekunde. Wiki moja inafaa kwa tovuti nyingi; tovuti ya habari inayochapisha kila saa inahitaji muda mchache zaidi.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Muda ambao kivinjari cha mgeni huhifadhi picha na hati','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Sekunde. Inatumika kwa picha, CSS na JavaScript pekee — kamwe haitumiki kwa kurasa. Weka 0 ili kuliacha hili kwa seva pangishi yako.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Wageni walioingia','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Usiwahi kutoa ukurasa uliohifadhiwa kwenye kache kwa mgeni aliyeingia','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'Washa ni jibu salama na ndilo chaguo-msingi. Kizime tu ikiwa unajua kila ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye akiba unafanana kwa kila mtumiaji aliyeingia — tovuti ya uanachama ndiyo sababu ya kawaida ya kutofanya hivyo.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Muda tofauti wa maisha kwa maudhui tofauti','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Kwa mfano: kurasa za bidhaa za duka kwa saa moja, wakati kila kitu kingine kinabaki kwa wiki moja.','Add a rule'=>'Ongeza kanuni','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','Seconds'=>'Sekunde','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Kache ya vipengee (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Mpangishaji wako anaendesha akiba ya siri ya vipengee vya Redis kwa ajili ya tovuti hii na kuiweka ikiwa imesanidiwa. Hakuna cha kusanidi hapa; hali iliyo juu ya skrini hii inaonyesha ikiwa inafanya kazi.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Huhifadhi matokeo ya maswali ya hifadhidata kwenye akiba. Husaidia zaidi kwenye duka lenye shughuli nyingi au tovuti yenye watumiaji wengi walioingia, ambapo akiba ya kurasa haiwezi kusaidia.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Sakinisha drop-in ya akiba ya vitu ya Redis','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Inahitaji kiendelezi cha phpredis. Ikiwa hakipo, kisanduku kilicho juu ya skrini hii kinaonyesha hivyo.','Redis host'=>'Mwenyeji wa Redis','Redis port'=>'Lango la Redis','Redis database'=>'Hifadhidata ya Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Ipe kila tovuti kwenye Redis inayoshirikiwa nambari yake yenyewe, la sivyo zitafuta akiba ya kumbukumbu ya kila mmoja.','Redis username'=>'Jina la mtumiaji wa Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Ni kwa seva ya Redis iliyo na watumiaji wa ACL pekee (Redis 6 au ya baadaye). Acha wazi ili uingie kwa kutumia nenosiri pekee.','Redis password'=>'Nenosiri la Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Acha wazi ikiwa Redis yako haihitaji.','Key prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha ufunguo','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Njia mbadala ya nambari tofauti ya hifadhidata wakati huwezi kuwa nayo.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Usafishaji otomatiki mahiri','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Futa kurasa zilizoathiriwa kiotomatiki wakati maudhui yanapobadilika','After updates'=>'Baada ya masasisho','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Futa kila kitu baada ya sasisho la mfumo mkuu, programu-jalizi au mandhari','After a comment'=>'Baada ya maoni','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Futa ukurasa wa chapisho wakati maoni juu yake yameidhinishwa','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Zima hii kwenye sehemu ya maoni yenye shughuli nyingi, ambapo inaweza kufuta ukurasa huo huo mamia ya mara kwa saa.','Never cache these'=>'Usiwahi kuweka akiba hizi','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Chaguo-msingi zinazofaa za WordPress na WooCommerce hutumiwa kila wakati — cart, checkout, my-account na kipindi chochote kilichoingia havihifadhiwi kamwe kwenye kache, chochote kilicho hapa chini.','Addresses'=>'Anwani','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Njia moja kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano <code>/basket</code>. Alama ya <code>*</code> mwishoni inalingana na kila kitu kilicho chini yake.','Query parameters'=>'Vigezo vya hoja','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ukurasa uliobeba mojawapo ya hizi hauhifadhiwi kamwe kwenye kache — kwa mfano tokeni ya hakikisho ya mara moja.','Cookies'=>'Vidakuzi','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Mgeni anayebeba mojawapo ya haya daima hupewa ukurasa mpya.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Kila ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye kache umetupwa. Itajengwa upya wageni wanapowasili.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'Akiba ya muda ya vitu imesakinishwa, lakini haihifadhi chochote.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Kache ya ukurasa imewashwa, lakini kurasa bado hazihifadhiwi.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress bado haijapakia drop-in ya akiba ya ukurasa. Itaanza wakati wa kupakia ukurasa unaofuata; ikiwa haitaanza, thibitisha kwamba WP_CACHE imewekwa kuwa true katika wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Hifadhi muda ya vipengee imewashwa, lakini seva hii haina usaidizi wa Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Ugani wa phpredis haujasakinishwa, kwa hivyo drop-in haiwezi kutumika na WordPress inarudi kwenye akiba yake ya ndani ya kumbukumbu. Uliza mtoa huduma wako wa upangishaji kuwezesha phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Hakuna kinachowekwa kwenye akiba.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Kache zote mbili zimezimwa, kwa hivyo programu-jalizi hii haifanyi tovuti kuwa ya kasi zaidi.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Akibashaji inatumika kwenye tovuti hii.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis imekataa jina la mtumiaji au nenosiri. Angalia vitambulisho vya Redis katika wp-config.php au kwenye skrini hii.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis imekubali kuingia lakini hairuhusu tovuti hii kuhifadhi funguo zake. Mtumiaji wa Redis anahitaji ruhusa ya kiambishi awali cha ufunguo wa tovuti hii.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis imekataa nambari ya hifadhidata. Angalia mpangilio wa hifadhidata ya Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis imeishiwa na kumbukumbu na inakataa data mpya.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Upanuzi wa phpredis haujasakinishwa, kwa hivyo WordPress inatumia akiba yake yenyewe ya kumbukumbu. Uliza mtoa huduma wako wa upangishaji kuwezesha phpredis.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'WP_REDIS_DISABLED imewekwa katika wp-config.php, kwa hivyo akiba ya vipengee imezimwa.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Seva ya Redis haikuweza kufikiwa. Angalia seva pangishi na lango la Redis, na kwamba Redis inafanya kazi.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis haikurudisha thamani iliyoandikwa punde. Angalia kumbukumbu za seva ya Redis.','Web server'=>'Seva ya wavuti','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — kurasa zimehifadhiwa kwenye kache na seva ya wavuti','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'Sio LiteSpeed — kurasa zimehifadhiwa kwenye diski na programu-jalizi hii','Pages stored on disk'=>'Kurasa zilizohifadhiwa kwenye diski','Redis support'=>'Usaidizi wa Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis imesakinishwa','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis haijasakinishwa','Page lifetime'=>'Uhai wa ukurasa','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Huruhusiwi kusafisha kache.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Ombi la kufuta kache limetumwa.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: drop-in nyingine ya object-cache imesakinishwa, kwa hivyo akiba ya vipengee ya Redis haisimamiwi na programu-jalizi hii.','detected'=>'Iligunduliwa','not detected'=>'Haikugunduliwa','phpredis extension missing'=>'Kiendelezi cha phpredis kinakosekana','installed, not storing anything'=>'imesakinishwa, haihifadhi chochote','active, managed by your host'=>'inafanya kazi, inasimamiwa na mpangishaji wako','active'=>'Amilifu','inactive'=>'Si amilifu','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Akiba ya LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Akiba ya vitu ya Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Kiendelezi cha Redis PHP (phpredis) hakipatikani kwenye seva hii, kwa hivyo akiba ya vipengee haiwezi kuwashwa.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Drop-in nyingine ya object-cache tayari imesakinishwa. Liondoe kabla ya kuwezesha akiba ya vipengee ya Zinn®.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Haikuweza kuandika faili ya usanidi wa muunganisho wa Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Drop-in ya object-cache iliyojumuishwa haikuweza kusomwa.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Haikuweza kusakinisha drop-in ya object-cache kwenye wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Haikuweza kuondoa drop-in ya object-cache.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Mfumo wa faili wa WordPress hauwezi kuandikwa, kwa hivyo drop-in ya object-cache haikuweza kudhibitiwa.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Programu-jalizi nyingine ya akiba ya ukurasa imesakinisha wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Ondoa programu-jalizi hiyo kwanza, au endelea kutumia akiba yake ya ukurasa.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Haikuweza kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/cache/zinn-cache, kwa hivyo kurasa haziwezi kuhifadhiwa kwenye kache.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'wp-content/advanced-cache.php haikuweza kuandikwa, kwa hivyo kurasa haziwezi kuhifadhiwa kwenye kache.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama madokezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua sasisho hili. Angalia ikiwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.','Go Pro'=>'Pata Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Skrini ya uchanganuzi wa akiba: uwiano wa vibonzo, kumbukumbu, funguo na amri za akiba zilizo polepole zaidi.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Kipataji cha hoja za polepole na miito isiyohifadhiwa kwenye kache inayotaja programu-jalizi au mandhari inayohusika.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Tabaka la APCu ndani ya kumbukumbu mbele ya Redis kwa vitufe vinavyotumika mara kwa mara, pamoja na uchukuaji wa awali, mgandamizo na kiserialishi cha igbinary.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Ufutaji unaotegemea vitambulisho kwa machapisho, istilahi na bidhaa za WooCommerce, ili kile kilichobadilika pekee kifutwe, huku kache za kurasa na vipengee zikifutwa pamoja.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Kupasha akiba kiotomatiki baada ya kusafisha, picha za WebP na AVIF, uondoaji wa CSS isiyotumika na ucheleweshaji wa JavaScript.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Usafishaji ulioratibiwa wa hifadhidata wenye hakikisho, na sheria za kache kwa kila ukurasa.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Arifa za hali ya kache katika dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital® wakati uwiano wa upatikanaji unapopungua au kumbukumbu inapojaa.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Kila kitu kwenye vichupo vingine ni bure na kitaendelea kuwa bure. Pro husakinishwa juu ya programu-jalizi hii na huongeza:','See what Pro costs'=>'Tazama bei ya Pro','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Kila mpango huanza na jaribio la bure la siku 14, hakuna kadi inayohitajika: %1$s kwa mwaka kwa tovuti moja, %2$s kwa tovuti tano, %3$s kwa tovuti zisizo na kikomo.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php haikupatikana, kwa hivyo WP_CACHE haikuweza kuwashwa. Ongeza define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); ndani yake.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php tayari inafafanua WP_CACHE kama false, kwa hivyo akiba ya ukurasa haiwezi kuanza. Ibadilishe kuwa true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php haiwezi kuandikwa, kwa hivyo WP_CACHE haikuweza kuwashwa. Ongeza define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); humo.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu mlalo','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu mlalo hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Copied'=>'Imenakiliwa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu-jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na ikiwa inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Weka upya kwa chaguo-msingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii itarejesha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii kwenye chaguomsingi yake. Ungependa kuendelea?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili ya mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina manenosiri, tokeni au funguo za API kamwe — utahitaji kuziingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerejeshwa kwa chaguomsingi yake.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chagua faili ya mipangilio iliyohamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hilo ni kubwa mno kuwa faili la kuhamisha mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo si faili la kuhamisha mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hilo lilihamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi tofauti (%s), kwa hivyo kuliingiza hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Manenosiri na vitufe vya API havijumuishwi kamwe katika uhamishaji, kwa hivyo viweke tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeagizwa. Nenosiri na funguo za API huwa hazijumuishwi katika uhamishaji, kwa hivyo ziweke tena.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna kitu kinachohitaji kuangaliwa','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inatumika kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu-jalizi hii haikueleza sababu. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi nasi tutaangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho %s zilizopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(hufunguka katika kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho hasa kitakachotumwa — hakuna kingine, na hakuna kilichofichwa. Nywila zako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo humu.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao wa kunakili','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tikiti ya usaidizi na kujibu kwa barua pepe. Ikiwa ungependelea kutoituma, inakili hapo juu na uibandike mwenyewe kwenye tikiti.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatuwezi kufikia Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna hitilafu yoyote katika mipangilio yako.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Dawati la usaidizi la Zinn® limepokea ripoti yako na litajibu kwa barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Dawati la usaidizi la Zinn® limepokea ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na litajibu kwa barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — ripoti za awali zimefika.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kukubali ripoti sasa hivi — hilo ni kosa la upande wetu, si wako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Inakili hapo juu na ufungue tiketi, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Mteja wa upangishaji? Pata punguzo la %1$d%% kwenye %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Kama mteja wa upangishaji wa Zinn Digital® unapata msimbo binafsi wa punguzo la %d%% kwenye malipo yako ya kwanza. Usasishaji ni kwa bei ya kawaida.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Pata nambari yangu ya %d%% na uende kulipa','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, hauruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Punguzo hili ni la wateja walio na mpango wa upangishaji unaolipiwa ulio katika hali nzuri. Majaribio ya bure hayajumuishwi.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Tayari umetumia punguzo lako la mteja wa upangishaji kwa programu-jalizi hii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hatujaweza kupata nambari yako ya kuthibitisha sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ukarimu wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitiwa, vikoa na nafasi za viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu ambao hii ndiyo kazi yao ya kujiingizia kipato','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizo tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutuma maombi.','Style preset'=>'Weka mapema mtindo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Mahali pa kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinakibatilisha.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>