 access to the %s features.'=>'Pindi leseni yako itakapoisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bila Malipo lakini HAUTAWEZA kufikia vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Pindi leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake, hutaweza tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiwasha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutakuwa na ufikiaji wa masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vya %2$s, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kupata toleo jipya.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya %1$s yako ya bila malipo, lipa kuanzia %2$s tu','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubali na Uwashe Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Ninakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina Zote','allow'=>'Ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Tayari umechagua kujiunga na ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Tayari umechagua kujiunga na ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuiboresha.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni yasiyotambulika','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Tuma ombi la kuwa mshirika','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Idhinisha na Uanze Jaribio','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Tafadhali tuambie sababu ili tuweze kuboresha.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia kuboresha hapa chini na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia wakati wa ununuzi nasi tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Husisha na akaunti ya mmiliki wa leseni.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Mwandishi','Invalid module ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha moduli si sahihi.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Huna leseni halali ya kufikia toleo la kulipia.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Usakinishaji wa kiotomatiki hufanya kazi tu kwa watumiaji waliojijumuisha.','Premium version already active.'=>'Toleo la kulipia tayari linatumika.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Toleo la programu-jalizi ya kulipia tayari limesakinishwa.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Programu-jalizi ni "Serviceware" ambayo inamaanisha haina toleo la msimbo wa kulipia.','Automatic Installation'=>'Usanikishaji wa Kiotomatiki','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Zima kiotomatiki baada ya:','Average Rating'=>'Wastani wa Ukadiriaji','Awesome'=>'Ajabu','based on %s'=>'kulingana na %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Kuwa mshirika','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Umependa %s? Kuwa balozi wetu na ujipatie pesa ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Habari, je, ulijua kuwa %1$s ina programu ya ushirika? Ikiwa unapenda %2$s unaweza kuwa balozi wetu na kupata pesa taslimu!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Bora','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sasisho la toleo la Beta litachukua nafasi ya toleo lako lililosakinishwa la %s na toleo jipya zaidi la Beta - tumia kwa tahadhari, na si kwenye tovuti zilizopo hewani. Umeonywa.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Inatozwa %s','Billing'=>'Malipo','Billing & Invoices'=>'Malipo na Ankara','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Imezuiwa','Blocking'=>'Inazuia','Blog ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Blogu','Body'=>'Mwili','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ndiyo - anwani zote mbili ni zangu','Bundle'=>'Kifurushi','Bundle Plan'=>'Mpango wa Kifurushi','Business name'=>'Jina la biashara','Buy license'=>'Nunua leseni','Buy a license now'=>'Nunua leseni sasa','Cancel'=>'Ghairi','Cancel Installation'=>'Ghairi Usakinishaji','Cancel Subscription'=>'Ghairi Usajili','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Ikiwa HUPANGI kutumia hii %1$s kwenye tovuti hii (au tovuti nyingine yoyote) - je, ungependa kughairi %2$s pia?','Cancel Trial'=>'Ghairi Jaribio','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Kughairi jaribio kutazuia ufikiaji wa vipengele vyote vinavyolipiwa mara moja. Je, una uhakika?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Ghairi %s na Uendelee','Cancelled'=>'Imeghairiwa','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Inaghairi usajili','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Huwezi kupata ufunguo wako wa leseni?','Change License'=>'Badilisha Leseni','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa kwa %s hivi punde. Lazima uthibitishe sasisho ndani ya saa 4 zijazo. Ikiwa huwezi kupata barua pepe hiyo, tafadhali kagua folda yako ya barua taka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa hivi punde kwa %s. Mmiliki wa barua pepe lazima athibitishe sasisho ndani ya saa 4 zijazo.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s ndiye mmiliki mpya wa akaunti.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Asante kwa kuthibitisha mabadiliko ya umiliki. Barua pepe imetumwa hivi punde kwa %s ili kuidhinishwa hatimaye.','Change Ownership'=>'Badilisha Umiliki','Change Plan'=>'Badilisha Kifurushi','Change User'=>'Badilisha Mtumiaji','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Kwa kubadilisha mtumiaji, unakubali kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti kwa:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Kumbukumbu ya mabadiliko','Changing user, please wait'=>'Inabadilisha mtumiaji, tafadhali subiri','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Ikiwa hukupokea barua pepe hiyo, jaribu kuangalia folda yako ya taka au utafute barua pepe kutoka kwa %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Kamilisha ununuzi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Chagua hadi tovuti %s ili kuwezesha leseni.','City'=>'Jiji','Clear API Cache'=>'Futa Akiba ya API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Futa Data za Muda za Masasisho','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bofya hapa','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Bofya hapa ili kutumia programu-jalizi bila kukutambulisha','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Bofya ili kuona maoni yaliyotoa ukadiriaji wa %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s ni anwani ya barua pepe ya mteja wangu','Code'=>'Msimbo','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kodi ya %s mteja anaponunua leseni mpya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kwa kuwa tunatenga siku 30 kwa ajili ya uwezekano wa kurejeshewa pesa, tunalipa kamisheni ambazo zina zaidi ya siku 30 pekee.','Communication'=>'Mawasiliano','Compatible up to'=>'Inaoana hadi','complete the opt-in'=>'Kamilisha kujiunga','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hongera','Never miss an important update'=>'Usiwahi kukosa sasisho muhimu','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Asante kwa kusasisha hadi %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Jiunge ili kupokea arifa za barua pepe za masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, maudhui ya mafunzo, na ofa za hapa na pale, na kushiriki maelezo ya kimsingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na ifanye vizuri zaidi kile unachohitaji.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Chagua kupokea arifa za barua pepe kuhusu masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vipya, maudhui ya elimu, na ofa za mara kwa mara, pamoja na kushiriki baadhi ya maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukipuuza hili, hakuna shida! %1$s bado itafanya kazi vizuri kabisa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeanzisha chaguo hili ili usikose kamwe sasisho muhimu na utusaidie kuifanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kutekeleza kile unachohitaji.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tunayo furaha kutambulisha muunganisho wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha tuligundua tovuti %s kwenye mtandao ambazo bado zinasubiri usikivu wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha tuligundua tovuti %d ambazo bado zinasubiri kuwezesha leseni.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kutumia %s kwenye tovuti hizo, tafadhali weka ufunguo wako wa leseni hapa chini na ubofye kitufe cha kuwezesha.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Vinginevyo, unaweza kuruka hatua hii kwa sasa na kuwezesha leseni baadaye, kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti wa kiwango cha mtandao wa %s yako.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Ukishamaliza, lemaza %s na uiwashe tena.','Contact'=>'Wasiliana','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Tafadhali tujulishe ikiwa ungependa tuwasiliane nawe kwa ajili ya masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, maudhui ya elimu na matoleo ya mara kwa mara:','Contact Support'=>'Wasiliana na Dawati la Usaidizi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Samahani kwa usumbufu na tuko hapa kusaidia ukitupa nafasi.','Contact Us'=>'Wasiliana Nasi','Please contact us here'=>'Tafadhali wasiliana nasi hapa','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Tafadhali wasiliana nasi kwa ujumbe ufuatao:','Continue'=>'Endelea','Contributors'=>'Wachangiaji','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Haikuweza kuwezesha %s.','Country'=>'Nchi','Cron Type'=>'Aina ya Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Tunatumia maktaba ya PHP cURL kwa miito ya API, ambayo ni maktaba ya kawaida sana na mara nyingi husakinishwa na kuamilishwa tangu awali. Kwa bahati mbaya, cURL haijaamilishwa (au imezimwa) kwenye se