3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea %3$s ya %1$s kwenye kisanduku chako cha barua pepe kwa %2$s ndani ya dakika 5 zijazo.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Msimbo wa Posta',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>' %1$s ili kufikia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vya toleo %2$s, na usaidizi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'Usasishaji otomatiki wa usalama na vipengele vya %1$s na utendakazi unaolipiwa utaendelea kufanya kazi bila kukatizwa hadi %2$s (au leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake, chochote kitakachotangulia).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s ili upate masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vya toleo la %2$s, pamoja na usaidizi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuweka hali ya beta ya mtumiaji.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kubadilisha hali ya white-label ya leseni.','Annual'=>'Kila mwaka','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", %s hataweza tena kuona jina na barua pepe yako.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Opt Out", data ya uchunguzi haitatumwa tena kwa %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Kwa kukata muunganisho wa tovuti, data ya uchunguzi iliyoshirikiwa hapo awali kuhusu %1$s itafutwa na haitaonekana tena kwa %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Kwa kujiondoa katika kushiriki maelezo haya na seva ya masasisho, itabidi uangalie matoleo mapya ya %1$s na kuyapakua na kuyasakinisha wewe mwenyewe. Si usumbufu tu, bali kukosa sasisho kunaweza kuweka tovuti yako hatarini na kusababisha masuala yasiyo ya lazima ya utangamano, kwa hivyo tunapendekeza sana kuweka ruhusa hizi muhimu zikiwa zimewashwa.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Ghairi %1$s - Sihitaji tena sasisho zozote za usalama na vipengele, wala usaidizi wa %2$s kwa sababu sipangi kutumia %3$s kwenye tovuti hii, au tovuti nyingine yoyote.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ghairi %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Inaghairi %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Inaghairi %s...','Click here'=>'Bofya hapa','Deactivating'=>'Inazima','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Kutenganisha tovuti kutaondoa %s kabisa kutoka kwenye akaunti ya Dashibodi yako ya Mtumiaji.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Kwa uwasilishaji wa kiotomatiki wa masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na usimamizi na ulinzi wa leseni, %s inahitaji:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Kwa utoaji wa sasisho za usalama na vipengele, na usimamizi wa leseni, %s inahitaji','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius ni injini yetu ya leseni na masasisho ya programu','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ikiwa hii ni nakala ya muda mrefu, ili kudumisha sasisho za kiotomatiki na utendaji uliolipwa baada ya %1$s, tafadhali %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Je, %2$s ni nakala ya %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Jiunge na Mpango wa Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Jiunge na mpango wa Beta','License'=>'Leseni','License Key'=>'Ufunguo wa Leseni','License key'=>'Ufunguo wa leseni','Monthly'=>'Kila mwezi','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Majina, vibainishi (slugs), matoleo, na kama yanatumika au la','New Version Available'=>'Toleo Jipya Linapatikana','Optional'=>'Hiari','Plan'=>'Kifurushi','Products'=>'Bidhaa','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Kushiriki data ya utambuzi husaidia kutoa utendakazi wa ziada unaofaa kwa tovuti yako, kuepuka kutooana kwa matoleo ya WordPress au PHP kunakoweza kuharibu tovuti, na kutambua ni lugha na maeneo gani ambayo %s inapaswa kutafsiriwa na kuboreshwa kwayo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Ili uweze kutumia tena leseni wakati %s haifanyi kazi tena.','Subscription'=>'Usajili','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s itakuwa ikituma data muhimu ya leseni mara kwa mara kwa %2$s ili kuangalia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na kuthibitisha uhalali wa leseni yako.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Kuna %1$s ya %2$s inayopatikana.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Ili kuhakikisha uoanifu na kuepuka migongano na programu-jalizi na mandhari ulizosakinisha.','Trial'=>'Jaribio','View %s State'=>'Tazama Hali ya %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Tazama Maelezo ya Msingi ya %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ndiyo, %2$s ni nakala ya %4$s kwa madhumuni ya kujaribu, staging, au utengenezaji.','You have a %s license.'=>'Una leseni ya %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Umenunua leseni ya %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho ya %1$s kwenye kisanduku chako cha barua pepe katika %2$s. Tafadhali hakikisha umebofya kitufe kilicho kwenye barua pepe hiyo ili %3$s.','days'=>'siku','deactivating'=>'Inazima','hour'=>'saa','hours'=>'saa','license'=>'Leseni','optional'=>'ya hiari','products'=>'Bidhaa','skip'=>'Ruka','subscription'=>'Usajili','trial'=>'Majaribio','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Bidhaa','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Inawasha','as software licenseLicense'=>'Leseni','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','close windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','like websitesSites'=>'Tovuti','nounPricing'=>'Bei','trial periodTrial'=>'Jaribio','verbOpt In'=>'Jiunge rasmi','verbOpt Out'=>'Jiondoe','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','verbUpgrade'=>'Boresha','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Kitendo hakikuweza kukamilika. Jaribu tena, na ikiwa itaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na msimamizi wa tovuti.','Connect an AI app'=>'Unganisha programu ya AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Ombi hili la muunganisho limeisha muda wake. Rudi kwenye programu na uanze kuunganisha tena.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s inaomba kutumia %2$s kwenye tovuti hii kama %3$s. Inaweza kufanya kile tu ambacho akaunti yako ya WordPress inaruhusiwa kufanya, na unaweza kuiondoa wakati wowote kutoka kwenye mipangilio ya mawakala wa AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ilijitambulisha kutoka %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s imejisajili yenyewe kiotomatiki. Endelea tu ikiwa ulianzisha hii kutoka %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Akaunti yako haiwezi kutumia zana hizi kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Baada ya kujibu utarudi kwenye %s.','Allow %s'=>'Ruhusu %s','Do not allow'=>'Usiruhusu','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Thamani inayohitajika inakosekana au ina umbizo lisilo sahihi. Angalia muundo wa ingizo (input schema) wa uwezo huo.','The site refused the request.'=>'Tovuti imekataa ombi.','Unknown tool.'=>'Zana isiyojulikana.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Ruhusu wasaidizi wa AI kama vile Claude, Cursor au VS Code wakufanyie kazi kwenye tovuti hii kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress (Claude na ChatGPT kwa kuwaidhinisha hapa, wengine kwa nenosiri la programu) na wanaweza kufanya kile tu ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Mawakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au ya baadaye. Sasisha WordPress ili kuwatumia.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Anwani ya muunganisho (kikomo cha MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude na ChatGPT: ingia badala yake','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ongeza anwani ya muunganisho kama kiunganishi maalum katika Claude, au kama programu katika hali ya msanidi wa ChatGPT. Hufungua tovuti hii ili uweze kuidhinisha; hakuna nenosiri la kunakili.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Programu za AI zilizounganishwa kwenye akaunti yako:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Programu nyingine za AI: nenosiri la programu','Create an application password for your user'=>'Unda nenosiri la programu kwa ajili ya mtumiaji wako','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ongeza hii kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, ukitumia jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: weka ingizo hilohilo chini ya "servers" katika .vscode/mcp.json, si chini ya "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Nyaraka za msanidi programu: uwezo, REST na MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'Kagua na ufute akiba ya tovuti hii na ubadilishe mipangilio yake ya akiba ukitumia Zinn® Cache.','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'Hali, ufutaji na mipangilio ya kache ya ukurasa na kipengee.','Read the cache status'=>'Soma hali ya akiba','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'Hurejesha ikiwa kache ya ukurasa na kache ya kitu zimewashwa na zinafanya kazi, kurasa ngapi zimehifadhiwa kwenye kache, na idadi ya miunganisho na matokeo mazuri ya kache ya kitu.','Read the cache settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya kache','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Hurejesha kila mpangilio wa kache. Nenosiri la Redis halirudishwi kamwe, ila tu ikiwa kuna lililohifadhiwa.','Change the cache settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya kache','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'Hubadilisha mipangilio unayotuma na kubakiza iliyobaki (kache ya ukurasa, muda ambao kurasa hukaa kwenye kache, kache ya kipengee na muunganisho wake wa Redis, sheria za kusafisha na vizuizi). Thamani huangaliwa na kusahihishwa kama ilivyo kwenye skrini ya Kache.','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'Rudisha mipangilio ya akiba kwenye chaguo-msingi','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'Hurejesha kila mpangilio wa kache kwenye chaguo-msingi lake, kama kitufe cha Weka Upya kinavyofanya. Nenosiri lililohifadhiwa la Redis huondolewa pia.','Read the diagnostics report'=>'Soma ripoti ya uchunguzi','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'Hurejesha ripoti ya uchunguzi ambayo usaidizi huomba: matoleo, vikomo vya seva, hali ya akiba na hitilafu za hivi karibuni. Haishikilii manenosiri au funguo zozote.','Purge the cache'=>'Futa kache','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Hufuta kurasa zilizohifadhiwa kwenye kache: kila kitu (all: true), baadhi ya anwani (urls) au kila kitu kilicho na lebo (tags). Kurasa hujengwa upya wageni wanapowasili.']];